  "solution": {
    "text": "According to question, $u_1=40 \\mathrm{~km} / \\mathrm{h}, v_1=0$ and $s_1=40 \\mathrm{~m}$ using $v^2-u^2=2 a s ; 0^2-40^2=2 a \\times 40$..(i) Again, $0^2-80^2=2$ as From eqn. (i) and (ii)\nStopping distance, $s=160 \\mathrm{~m}$",
